**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/uploads
**/data
**/.paddlex
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/frontend
**/fw
**/docs
**/scripts
**/.git
**/.terraform
**/secrets
**/tests
# Markdown docs only. Runtime prompts must be Python modules under app/…
# (see infra/docker/assert_runtime_assets.py) — never ship them as *.md.
**/*.md
!**/README.md
